@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@month = 2026-10
@proposalId = replace-with-the-reviewed-proposal-id

### Demo: current local date, no credentials. Proposal is NOT a ledger entry.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo_001

{"text":"despesa;42,90;FOOD;Almoço;hoje"}

### Inspect the proposed fields; copy proposals[0].id into proposalId above.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/proposals/{{proposalId}}

### Confirm after review. Repeat to get 200 + Confirmation-Replayed: true.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/proposals/{{proposalId}}/confirm

### Audit metadata (newest 100 events)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/proposals/{{proposalId}}/audit

### Current month totals, independent of the fixed example month above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/summary

### Bounded query; adjust month as needed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?month={{month}}&category=FOOD&page=0&size=20

### Demo: query the configured month
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"resumo;{{month}}"}

### Structured manual proposal. Historical fixture date; do not claim current data.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{"direction":"INCOME","amount":3500.00,"category":"SALARY","description":"Salário fictício","occurredOn":"2026-10-01"}

### Invalid amount -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{"direction":"EXPENSE","amount":-2,"category":"FOOD","description":"Almoço","occurredOn":"2026-10-01"}

### Future date -> 422 (future relative to this project's verification date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{"direction":"EXPENSE","amount":20,"category":"FOOD","description":"Almoço","occurredOn":"2099-01-01"}

### Invalid period -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/summary?month=2026-13

### Live: requires active live profile + server-side API key. Can incur provider charges.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Registre meu almoço de 42 reais e 90 centavos em alimentação hoje."}

### Live audio: set a local WAV path below. Demo returns 503.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/audio
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LedgerVoiceBoundary

--LedgerVoiceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="command.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< /path/to/your/command.wav
--LedgerVoiceBoundary--

### Live speech: binary MP3 with X-Audio-Origin: AI-generated. Demo returns 503.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/speech
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Proposta pronta para revisão. Confira os dados antes de confirmar."}

### Local health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
